        `the person was employed by or acting for another` IS TRUE
        `the person was a trustee, administrator or executor` IS FALSE
        `the person was serving the Government or was under a corporation or public body` IS FALSE
        `the person was a subcontractor, or employed by or acting for a subcontractor` IS FALSE

