§ `s 2: gratification and agent`

#ASSERT `the thing is a gratification` gMoney
#ASSERT `the thing is a gratification` gOffice
#ASSERT `the thing is a gratification` gDischarge
#ASSERT `the thing is a gratification` gService
#ASSERT `the thing is a gratification` gOffer
#ASSERT NOT (`the thing is a gratification` gNone)
#ASSERT `the person is an agent` agEmployee
#ASSERT `the person is an agent` agTrustee
#ASSERT `the person is an agent` agServing
#ASSERT NOT (`the person is an agent` agNone)
-- subcontractor is an agent only for s 8
#ASSERT NOT (`the person is an agent` agSub)
#ASSERT `the person is an agent for the purposes of section 8` agSub
#ASSERT `the person is an agent for the purposes of section 8` agEmployee
#ASSERT NOT (`the person is an agent for the purposes of section 8` agNone)
GIVETH A `Presumption Facts`
pDirect MEANS
    `Presumption Facts` WITH
        `the gratification was paid or given to, or received by, a person in the employment of the Government or any department of the Government or of a public body` IS TRUE
        `the gratification was paid or given by, or received from, a person who has or seeks to have any dealing with the Government or any department of the Government or any public body` IS TRUE
        `the gratification was paid or given by, or received from, an agent of a person who has or seeks to have any dealing with the Government or any department of the Government or any public body` IS FALSE
        `the contrary is proved` IS FALSE

