§ `ss 23, 24, 25, 36: evidence`

#ASSERT `evidence of custom is made inadmissible by section 23` ceCustom
#ASSERT NOT (`evidence of custom is made inadmissible by section 23` ceCustomWrongProc)
#ASSERT NOT (`evidence of custom is made inadmissible by section 23` ceNoCustom)
#ASSERT `the court may take the disproportionate resources into consideration as corroboration` ceDisprop
#ASSERT `the court may take the disproportionate resources into consideration as corroboration` ceAccretion
-- can satisfactorily account
#ASSERT NOT (`the court may take the disproportionate resources into consideration as corroboration` ceAccounted)
-- not a trial or inquiry into the offences
#ASSERT NOT (`the court may take the disproportionate resources into consideration as corroboration` ceWrongProc)
-- s 24(2) nominee
#ASSERT `the court may take the disproportionate resources into consideration as corroboration` ceNomineeReason
-- held by another with no reason to believe it is for the accused
#ASSERT NOT (`the court may take the disproportionate resources into consideration as corroboration` ceNomineeNoReason)
#ASSERT `the accused is treated as holding the resources, property or accretion` ceNomineeReason
#ASSERT `the witness may not be presumed unworthy of credit by reason only of the payment` ceWitness
#ASSERT NOT (`the witness may not be presumed unworthy of credit by reason only of the payment` ceWitnessWrongProc)
#ASSERT `the court may require disclosure concerning the informer under section 36(3)` ceInformerTrial
#ASSERT NOT (`the court may require disclosure concerning the informer under section 36(3)` ceInformerTrialNo)
#ASSERT `the court may require disclosure concerning the informer under section 36(3)` ceInformerOther
#ASSERT NOT (`the court may require disclosure concerning the informer under section 36(3)` ceInformerOtherNo)
-- justice limb is for other proceedings
#ASSERT NOT (`the court may require disclosure concerning the informer under section 36(3)` ceInformerTrialOtherLimb)
